From 386b632cff77f1b1d52114e3f8f2d819720a61d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:56:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] audit3 H6: test_mt reads KMT's and KMW's layout from
 LODE.MAP's EQUs

ktest.Syms keeps the map's EQU lines (Syms.equ), and ktest.equ() reads
them without a machine, again whenever the map is rebuilt; test_mt's
equ() is that. MT_ENT and the TE_ fields, TX_VID, VF_DIRECT, SPF_BG,
SPF_FREEZE, the TS_ states and KMW's SE_ fields and MW_STK come from it,
and the field offsets written as numbers (+4, +6, +8, +10, +24, +25, +27,
+28, +30) are named. Every value is as the copies had it, so a field
that moves now moves the tests with it instead of reading garbage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GRD5wiUMCniTFB6AGgxU9p
---
 os/ktest.py         | 18 ++++++++-
 os/tests/test_mt.py | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

